## 5. Where LLM is used vs deterministic

* **Deterministic:**

  * File type detection
  * Conversion to Markdown
  * Image extraction
  * Heading detection
  * Chunking
  * Index building
  * TOC generation
  * Final document assembly
  * UI annotation

* **LLM-dependent:**

  * Mapping headings to template sections
  * Suggesting improved titles
  * Relevancy scoring for unmapped sections
  * Optional second-pass mapping

